<div class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-5xl flex-col gap-6">
  <%= render FlatPack::PageTitle::Component.new(
    title: "Components",
    subtitle: "Examples of single-select and multi-select categorisable component usage.",
    variant: :h1
  ) %>

  <div class="space-y-6 text-sm leading-6 text-(--surface-content-color)">
    <p>The category selector wraps FlatPack select inputs and supports both single-select and multi-select category fields.</p>
    <p>The render call looks the same for both modes. The single vs multiple behavior is declared with <code>Capabilities::Reference.enabled</code> using <code>selection: :single</code> or <code>selection: :multiple</code>.</p>

    <pre class="overflow-auto rounded-md bg-(--surface-muted-background-color) p-4 text-xs"><code>class Page < ApplicationRecord
  RecordingStudioCategorisable::Capabilities::Reference.enabled(
    recordable: self,
    attribute_name: :status_category_item_recording_id,
    selection: :single,
    category_group_key: "page-status",
    label: "Status"
  )

  RecordingStudioCategorisable::Capabilities::Reference.enabled(
    recordable: self,
    attribute_name: :topic_category_item_recording_ids,
    selection: :multiple,
    category_group_key: "page-topics",
    label: "Topics"
  )
end</code></pre>

    <div class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-base font-semibold">Single-select sample</h2>
      <% if @brief_status_field.present? %>
        <%= render RecordingStudioCategorisable::CategorySelector::Component.new(
          name: "brief[status_category_item_recording_id]",
          field: @brief_status_field,
          recordable: @sample_brief,
          item_recordings: @brief_status_item_recordings
        ) %>
      <% else %>
        <p class="text-(--surface-muted-content-color)">Single-select field configuration was not found.</p>
      <% end %>

      <pre class="overflow-auto rounded-md bg-(--surface-muted-background-color) p-4 text-xs"><code>render RecordingStudioCategorisable::CategorySelector::Component.new(
  name: "brief[status_category_item_recording_id]",
  field: status_field,
  recordable: brief,
  item_recordings: status_item_recordings
)</code></pre>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-base font-semibold">Multiple-select sample</h2>
      <% if @page_topics_field.present? %>
        <%= render RecordingStudioCategorisable::CategorySelector::Component.new(
          name: "page[topic_category_item_recording_ids]",
          field: @page_topics_field,
          recordable: @sample_page,
          item_recordings: @page_topics_item_recordings
        ) %>
      <% else %>
        <p class="text-(--surface-muted-content-color)">Multiple-select field configuration was not found.</p>
      <% end %>

      <pre class="overflow-auto rounded-md bg-(--surface-muted-background-color) p-4 text-xs"><code>render RecordingStudioCategorisable::CategorySelector::Component.new(
  name: "page[topic_category_item_recording_ids]",
  field: topics_field,
  recordable: page,
  item_recordings: topic_item_recordings
)</code></pre>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
